<title>BELGIUM: EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</title>
<headline>EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union duties on imports of molasses will remain suspended for a further week until July 23, EU officials said.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for imports of cane molasses was set at 8.47 Ecus per 100 kg, against 8.35 previously.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for beet molasses was set at 12.52 Ecus per 100 kg, against 12.29.</p>
</text>
